    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40612" root="نهج" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَهْجٌ</span></b>  (S, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَهجٌ</span></b>  (L) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْهَجٌ</span></b>  and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْهَاجٌ</span></b>  (S, K) <i>A manifest, plainly apparent,</i> or
<i>open, road,</i> or <i>way:</i> (S, L, K:) and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرِيقٌ</span>
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاهِجَةٌ</span></b> : (TA, from a trad.:) pl. of the ??
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَهْجَاتٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُهُجٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُهُوجٌ</span>: (L:) [and of the third
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنَاهِج</span>]. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طُرُقٌ نَهْجَهٌ</span> <i>Manifest roads,</i> or <i>ways.</i>
(L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَهْجُ الطَّرِيقِ</span> [<i>The plain,</i> or <i>open,
track of the road</i>]. (M, K, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سن</span>.)

